---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import {getPosts,path} from '../site';
import {issues,newsDate} from '../lib/news';
const posts=await getPosts();const categories=[...new Set(posts.map(p=>p.data.category))];const issue=issues[0];
---
<Base>
<section class="personal-intro">
<div class="horizon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 900 150" fill="none"><path d="M8 105c101-4 156-14 215-11 72 4 95-12 152-10 77 3 105 15 167 11 90-7 154-1 250 7 42 4 67 4 100 2"/><path class="distant-line" d="M77 115c121 0 185-11 271-10m51 6c105-4 150-4 238 6m87-7 105 4"/><g class="little-boat"><path d="m672 74 18-33v33h-18Zm22-29 13 29h-13V45Z"/><path class="boat-hull" d="m666 80 48-1-10 13-28-1-10-11Z"/><path d="M664 98h53m-42 6h31"/></g></svg><span>在这里，留一点自己的东西。</span></div>
<div class="intro-copy"><p>你好，我是 <a class="inline-token" href={path('about/')}>海波东 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>，一名关注 <a class="inline-token" href={path('tags/AI工程/')}>AI 工程</a> 与 <a class="inline-token" href={path('tags/交互设计/')}>交互设计</a> 的工程师。</p><p>这里记录做东西的过程，也放一些关于创作和成长的思考。文章可以读，可以听，也可以看视频。</p><p class="intro-secondary">最近在整理 <a href={path('news/')}>每日新闻 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>，把值得关注的变化和原始出处放在一起。</p></div>
</section>
<section class="home-writing" aria-labelledby="writing-title"><div class="section-title"><h1 id="writing-title">最近的记录</h1><a href={path('archive/')}>全部文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="按分类筛选"><button class="selected" data-category="全部" aria-pressed="true">全部</button>{categories.map(c=><button data-category={c} aria-pressed="false">{c}</button>)}</div><div class="post-stack" id="posts">{posts.map((p,i)=><div data-post-category={p.data.category}><PostCard post={p} index={i}/></div>)}</div></section>
<section class="home-daily" aria-labelledby="daily-title"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="daily-title">新闻小报</h2><a href={path('news/')}>翻开这一期 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><a class="daily-paper" href={path('news/')}><div class="paper-date"><span>{issue.date.slice(5,7)} 月</span><strong>{issue.date.slice(8)}</strong><small>{issue.date.slice(0,4)}</small></div><div class="paper-content"><span class="eyebrow">{newsDate(issue.date)} · {issue.stories.length} 条精选</span><h3>{issue.title}</h3><p>{issue.stories.slice(0,3).map(s=>s.sourceName.replace(' Changelog','').replace(' Blog','')).join(' / ')} 等</p><span class="paper-open">查看原始来源与本期导读 ↗</span></div></a></section>
<section class="home-notes"><div><h2>沿着一个主题读下去</h2><p>有些问题，值得多花一点时间。</p></div><div class="topic-links"><a href={path('tags/AI工程/')}><span>AI 工程</span><small>系统、工具与真实任务</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href={path('tags/交互设计/')}><span>交互设计</span><small>内容怎样变成好用的界面</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href={path('tags/创作/')}><span>个人创作</span><small>把想法做成看得见的东西</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></section>
</Base>
<script>const buttons=document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.filters [data-category]');buttons.forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{buttons.forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('selected',b===btn);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===btn))});document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-post-category]').forEach(el=>{el.hidden=btn.dataset.category!=='全部'&&el.dataset.postCategory!==btn.dataset.category})}));</script>
